T*
/F2 13 Tf (A.2 Solo play against the Warden) Tj T* /F1 11 Tf
T*
(A solo player competes against an automated opponent called the Warden. The Warden has) Tj T*
(no hand. At the start of each of its turns, flip the top terrain tile and place it) Tj T*
(touching the most recently placed tile, with its ridge edge facing the nearest ridge) Tj T*
(line where possible. The Warden then raises a stone on the tile it just placed, unless) Tj T*
(that tile is bog.) Tj T*
T*
(You win if your score beats the Warden's score by at least ten points. The Warden never) Tj T*
(claims sigils, but it scores two points for every weather card turned over during its) Tj T*
(own turns.) Tj T*
T*
